I didn’t know if it was the alcohol, or the nostalgia, or the way Chloe was already belting the lyrics under her breath—but something about it all made my shoulders drop, my body relax. Maybe I could just… enjoy tonight. Maybe I could have this—just for a little while.

“Okay, but like—” Chloe twisted toward me, eyes sparkling, “which dad do you think is the hottest?”

