Chloe, oblivious, propped herself up on her elbows. “She should be! She has a hot hockey boyfriend who worships her!”

I stiffened.

Alex’s gaze flicked to Chloe, then back to me. “Oh yeah?” she said, voice flat. “Because from where I’m standing, it looks less like ‘worship’ and more like ‘control.’”

