Chloe poured another round of wine, her cheeks flushed from alcohol and laughter. Dancing Queen blasted through the dorm, and for once, I let myself lean into the moment—let myself

be carried by the music, the warmth of the room, the dizzy, golden haze of wine swirling in my veins.

